WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.460
Two steps.

2
00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:03.948
Then the film goes to a lab to be developed.

3
00:00:04.498 --> 00:00:05.933
The film is finished.

4
00:00:05.933 --> 00:00:11.708
After the last picture, keep turning the green winder until the arrow on the dial

5
00:00:11.708 --> 00:00:12.317
stops moving.

6
00:00:12.317 --> 00:00:13.973
Then give it three more turns.

7
00:00:13.973 --> 00:00:18.803
The arrow no longer moves: all the film is back in its shell, in the dark.

8
00:00:18.803 --> 00:00:21.603
Only now is it safe to open the back.

9
00:00:21.603 --> 00:00:26.931
If the arrow is still moving, keep winding; never open the back before it stops.

